    "details": "<p><strong>What it is:</strong><br />AI can build an app in minutes. Proving it works is the real skill and the one that gets you hired. Take a real app, test it, fix what breaks, and prove it performs on Mozark's platform, on real devices.</p>\n<p><strong>Who can enter:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>College and university students across India and the US.</li>\n<li>Open to participants aged 18 and over.</li>\n<li>All skill levels welcome. You do not need to be a coder.</li>\n<li>Free to enter.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>How it works:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Register</strong> on https://www.mozark.ai/back-to-campus</li>\n<li><strong>Sign up on Mozark</strong> with the same email you registered with - https://id.mozark.ai/signup</li>\n<li><strong>Explore the Starter Org</strong>, a pre-loaded demo space for TCM, Infra and MCP.</li>\n<li><strong>Create your own organization,</strong>&nbsp;named StudentName_Collegename.</li>\n<li><strong>Invite <a href=\"mailto:support@mozark.ai\">support@mozark.ai</a> as an admin</strong> so we can track your progress.&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>You're all set to start the challenge! <br /><br />What counts as a valid bug:</strong></p>\n<p>Your bug has to be real to score.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Scores: it breaks a key user journey and fails consistently (at least 2 of 3 runs).</li>\n<li>Doesn't score: typos and minor colour or style tweaks.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Scoring:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>A fixed 100-point scale across the two rounds, plus a separate 50-point bonus.</li>\n<li>Every point is earned on evidence, not activity.</li>\n<li>Defined criteria, not a judgment call, so you always know where you stand on the leaderboard.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Build it. Test it. Fix it. Make it perform.</strong><br /><strong>Register now.&nbsp;</strong></p>",
    "end_date": "2026-11-14T00:00:00+05:30",
